{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（23日）早上10時半左右，一輛客貨車沿北角寶馬山道行駛，至賽西湖公園對開撞倒一名過路婦人。據報傷者清醒，但腳掌被車輪壓住。救援人員到場</p><p>救援人員到場將傷者救出，送往東區醫院治理；意外原因有待調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134823422782607360236890.jpeg/rVcNxZAbJXPVS5xJ4lZqODzzYnN3hFxXfIHDSXyBw0k\" alt=\"司機在場助查。\"><figcaption>司機在場助查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134823704770121728149735.jpeg/RZpXBLa-HrlYsr6GImKBFexD2Kc5-b2EarHQL2qx0C8\" alt=\"現場遺下一對拖鞋。\"><figcaption>現場遺下一對拖鞋。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134823701573931008356279.jpeg/Ei8jUqMQ8gEpXLi1BgKmTXGqIJDjMAJ-shW4HLIVuBw\" alt=\"警方在場調查。\"><figcaption>警方在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134823698692313088639128.jpeg/p9A_xISpthQjRtVeGiheS0spKRY4ZVoA6WpJNOlqSTQ\" alt=\"警員在涉事客貨車上調查。\"><figcaption>警員在涉事客貨車上調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-23T14:11:57.216774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}